Bantawa internal layout provenance notice

This internal layout adapts the repository's reviewed Nepali Basic phone
layout, which incorporates the Nepali mappings from xkeyboard-config
2.41 / Ubuntu package xkb-data 2.41-2ubuntu1.1. The complete upstream package
copyright and license text is retained at:

  layouts/internal/notices/xkb-data-2.41-2ubuntu1.1.copyright

Upstream source:
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xkeyboard-config/xkeyboard-config/-/blob/xkeyboard-config-2.41/symbols/np

Upstream license:
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/xkeyboard-config/xkeyboard-config/-/blob/xkeyboard-config-2.41/COPYING

Project modification: the Bantawa variant preserves the phone geometry and
replaces two unused independent-vowel positions on Shift with U+0907 DEVANAGARI
LETTER I and U+090F DEVANAGARI LETTER E. Ampixa claims no exclusive rights in
the upstream mappings.
